# Constraints

1. Return exactly one emotion record for every segment_index in this window; do not omit, duplicate, or return an out-of-window index. The top-level key is `emotions`.
2. Each record may contain only segment_index, emotion, sub_emotion, and intensity. intensity is a performance strength from 0.0 to 1.0.
3. emotion and sub_emotion must come from the allowed enum above. Set sub_emotion to null when no secondary emotion applies.
